<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pluma Inc started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pluma Inc started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it initiated coverage of Pluma Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $17 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Pluma could see above average earnings growth over the next &quot;few years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Pluma remained unchanged at 12-1/8.</p>
</text>
